      That is a negative.
    We need 10 more minutes.


01:01:43.167 --> 01:01:46.902
   <i> Being in this office-type</i>
   <i> setting under fluorescents</i>


01:01:46.904 --> 01:01:48.704
   <i> for the six-day work week,</i>


01:01:48.706 --> 01:01:51.239
     I think that ended up
       being much more...


01:01:51.241 --> 01:01:53.408
         of a challenge
    because I wasn't outside


01:01:53.410 --> 01:01:54.976
      and doing anything.


01:01:54.978 --> 01:01:56.078
     Firehouse, Genevieve.


01:01:57.947 --> 01:01:59.047
         Sure, one sec.


01:02:00.249 --> 01:02:04.286
      <i> Trying to break out</i>
     <i> of that rut of just...</i>


01:02:04.288 --> 01:02:06.254
           <i> waking...</i>
        <i> going to work...</i>


01:02:06.256 --> 01:02:08.090
           <i> eating...</i>
          <i> sleeping...</i>


01:02:08.092 --> 01:02:10.726
  <i> and doing it all over again.</i>


01:02:10.728 --> 01:02:11.993
     Firehouse, Genevieve.


01:02:20.803 --> 01:02:22.404
      <i> A lot of people work</i>
         <i> the same thing</i>


